  examples/host_coder/linenoise.{c,h} — linenoise (BSD-2-Clause, Copyright
  (c) 2010-2023 Salvatore Sanfilippo, Copyright (c) 2010-2013 Pieter
  Noordhuis), vendored at upstream commit a473823 (2026-05-01). Two deliberate
  patches (marked "pi-c patch" in linenoise.c): enable/disableRawMode use
  TCSADRAIN instead of TCSAFLUSH, so type-ahead queued across the REPL's
